WEBVTT

00:23:29.386 --> 00:23:32.835
AG: For Charles and his staff,
it felt good to be able to do something,

00:23:32.859 --> 00:23:36.400
and they were inspired to bring
more light and warmth -- literally.

00:23:36.950 --> 00:23:42.426
CH: The lights in our north tower
have this warm glow,

00:23:42.450 --> 00:23:45.998
and we came up with the idea
of putting messages in that north tower

00:23:46.022 --> 00:23:50.646
so that anybody who passes
would be able to see something from us.

00:23:50.670 --> 00:23:53.356
AG: With no one staying
in the north tower of the hotel,

00:23:53.380 --> 00:23:56.026
the dark windows were like a blank canvas.

00:23:56.050 --> 00:23:58.384
They could turn on the lights
inside certain rooms

00:23:58.408 --> 00:24:00.656
to beam shapes to the outside.